    "description": "Cycle counts and full inventories, with the difference between what the system expected and what was actually on the shelf. Each count records units and value both ways, works out the variance and the shrinkage percentage, and itemises every item that did not match with a reason and an action. A count worth less than expected asks to be investigated before the stock is adjusted.",
